      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your thesis statement is a good start, but it's a bit too vague. To make it more punchy, consider this: \"The electoral college is a rigged system that deliberately disenfranchises millions, allowing rural interests to override urban majorities and perpetuating a two-party stranglehold on American democracy.\"",
      "source": "target",
